    <item>
      <title>How AI is Changing the Fan Experience, with Jump’s Jordy Leiser</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-10-07/how-ai-is-changing-the-fan-experience-with-jump-s-jordy-leiser</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">6f051caea9e835339585d1dd</guid>
      <pubDate>Wed, 07 Oct 2026 14:21:56 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>There are a lot of concerns surrounding artificial intelligence’s creep into all aspects of day-to-day life, but Jordy Leiser also sees a lot of opportunity for AI to help sports fans. That’s why he co-founded the AI-powered fan experience and ticketing platform Jump alongside Marc Lore and Alex Rodriguez. On this week’s episode of The Deal, Jordy tells Alex and Jason Kelly how AI can help fans interact with their favorite teams and players, and how a new wave of team owners who made their money in tech are helping to power innovation in the sports industry. (Source: Bloomberg)</description>
